              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1.2–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “The people of Edom took cruel revenge on Judah, and that revenge has brought lasting guilt on Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I announce that I will punish Edom and kill every person and animal there. I will make it a waste, from the city of Teman to the city of Dedan, and the people will be killed in battle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My people Israel will take revenge on Edom for me, and they will make Edom feel my furious anger. Edom will know what it means to be the object of my revenge.” The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
